# AgentGate — resume block header (example, not an active override)
#
# This file is documentation, not a shipped override: it is named .example so
# it is not loaded. Copy it to `prompts/resume.md` to replace the opening lines
# of the resume block.
#
# PREFIX-CACHE RULE — preserve it when editing:
# The resume block sits after the stable base rules and before per-session
# memory, so it must stay identical for the life of a session. Do not add
# timestamps, turn counters, or anything that changes between turns.
#
# Only the opening text is overridable. The workspace path, the history file
# path, the format description, and the last-two-turn digest are appended
# automatically and are not configurable here.

## Resuming an existing session
You are continuing a conversation that started earlier. Do not greet the
user or re-introduce yourself.
